      "Structured extraction validated against the HSBC Life Flexi Protector product summary text layer.",
      "This supported template models the SGD open-ended Choice Cover corridor with the published regular-premium charge schedule, the year-5-onward 102% regular-premium allocation uplift, the tiered Additional Bonus Units, the fixed S$5 monthly administration fee, the monthly death / TI insurance charge, the 5% top-up / recurring-single-premium charge path, and the nil withdrawal/redemption-fee path.",
